window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Dr. Eden Draco lives in “The Cone” shaped sanctuary in the middle of Derinkegel. Only young and healthy people roam the Cone. She doesn’t have to pay for food and drinks, education, housing, medical care or anything having to do with her upkeep. </p> <p>With assigned partners, the government made sure all the workers have nothing to want for. She lives in total bliss and happiness but feels like something is missing. Eden seeks truth and knowledge in a world full of set lifestyles. All middle to lower level Ramsites are required to sleep in PODs, sleep canisters, that keep the users thoughts in the government’s power/manipulation. All lower level to middle level workers are required to work the “6-14-1” plan and sleep in the PODs. 6 days a week, 14 hours of work and 1 day to worship their supreme leader. Ramsey Duncan Jr.</p> <p>Eden must battle against the Drones and the RSPs (Ramsey secret police) of Derinkegel to find the answers she looking for. In a world where everyone has an incentive and obligation to turn their neighbors in, can she do it? Will she change the regime?</p>"; 
